# Dashboard (frontend/). Both folders are rebuilt from files that ARE committed, so they stay out of git:
#   node_modules/ is rebuilt by `npm install` from package.json + package-lock.json (both committed).
#   dist/ is the build output, rebuilt by `npm run build` from the source in frontend/src.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
